<title>SAN MARINO: TENNIS-MANTILLA CRUSHES GUSTAFSSON TO TAKE TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MANTILLA CRUSHES GUSTAFSSON TO TAKE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MARINO 1997-08-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Felix Mantilla swept aside Sweden's Magnus Gustafsson in straight sets in the final of the San Marino clay court tournament on Sunday to claim his fourth title of the season.</p>
<p>Mantilla, who lost last year's final to compatriot Alberto Costa in three sets, had an easier time this year. The tournament's top seed disposed of unseeded Gustafsson 6-4 6-1.</p>
<p>The victory followed up Mantilla's successes in Bologna, Gstaad and Umag over the last two months.</p>
</text>
